    "detailed_description": "Fight in online multiplayer battles with up to 64 players in this sequel to Honor &amp; Duty: D-Day. This game features visual enhancements, new maps, map reworks, brand new features and more.  Play in PVP matches or against bots with up to 3 other players for PVE action.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are five classes with a progression system allowing you to enhance each class with special abilities and perks. Weapons can be customized with a variety of attachments including scopes, grips, bayonets, weapon skins and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnline gameplay features epic matches with up to 64 players in multiple game modes including favorites such as Team Deathmatch, Attack &amp; Defend and Free For All. Battle on foot, jump in a tank or speed into action in a jeep, it's your choice!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe core mechanics have been reworked to be more intuitive along with major HUD &amp; UI overhauls which make the game more immersive. VR interactions have been significantly improved to allow for manual reloading of weapons.",
    "about_the_game": "Fight in online multiplayer battles with up to 64 players in this sequel to Honor &amp; Duty: D-Day. This game features visual enhancements, new maps, map reworks, brand new features and more.  Play in PVP matches or against bots with up to 3 other players for PVE action.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are five classes with a progression system allowing you to enhance each class with special abilities and perks. Weapons can be customized with a variety of attachments including scopes, grips, bayonets, weapon skins and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnline gameplay features epic matches with up to 64 players in multiple game modes including favorites such as Team Deathmatch, Attack &amp; Defend and Free For All. Battle on foot, jump in a tank or speed into action in a jeep, it's your choice!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe core mechanics have been reworked to be more intuitive along with major HUD &amp; UI overhauls which make the game more immersive. VR interactions have been significantly improved to allow for manual reloading of weapons.",
